 having different mothers 🞄(brothers);
 -bhrātṛ, m. step-broterh;
 -māsya, a. lasting two months;
 -ratha, n. (± yuddha) 🞄single combat with chariots;
 single 🞄fight;
 m. adversary;
 -rājya, n. dominion 🞄divided between two kings;
 frontier;
